function specialistCanMake(p,item,tileId){if(!civilianCraftEligible(p)||p._v25CycleTask)return false;if(Number(productionWorkerTile(p,item))!==Number(tileId))return false;if(item.workClass==='smithy')return p.job==='철공'&&p.workBuildingType29==='smithy';if(item.workClass==='craft_bow')return p.job==='목수';if(item.workClass==='craft')return p.job==='목수'||p.job==='건축가';return false;}
